  "solution": "Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math> dm (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>)là chiều rộng đáy bể, chiều dài đáy bể là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> dm.<br>\n\t\tChiều cao của bể là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>200</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>144</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> dm.<br>\n\t\tDiện tích xây bể (không có nắp, có đáy) là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>144</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>864</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>864</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mroot><mn>216</mn><mn>3</mn></mroot></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\tTa có bảng biến thiên\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/6805836e2474e217c67ab477dee415fc0769cb9ba472dba18e431d8271b5396e.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tDiện tích xây bể nhỏ nhất bằng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1296</mn><mroot><mn>216</mn><mn>3</mn></mroot></mfrac></semantics></math> dm<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msup><mi/><mn>2</mn></msup></semantics></math>=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1296</mn><mrow><mn>100</mn><mroot><mn>216</mn><mn>3</mn></mroot></mrow></mfrac></semantics></math> m<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msup><mi/><mn>2</mn></msup></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tChi phí lúc đó sẽ thấp nhất, và chi phí là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1296</mn><mrow><mn>100</mn><mroot><mn>216</mn><mn>3</mn></mroot></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>500</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>080</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">đồng</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>08</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><m